"""
mtui — Bloomberg-Style Sovereign Rating Terminal (Paperflow GFCR v6.0)
=============================================================================
A dense, keyboard-driven financial terminal that reads `paperflow`'s SQLite
databases (data/warehouse/paperflow.db + gfcr.db) directly and turns the
GFCR v6.0 11-module sovereign rating engine into a Bloomberg-grade terminal:

    ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ MTUI  PAPERFLOW GFCR v6.0 │ MACRO MATRIX  14:22:31  DB:LIVE   │
    ├───────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
    │ ◎DASHBOARD│  MACRO MATRIX — sorted by score ▾                 │
    │ ◈MACRO M..│  ISO  COUNTRY      SCORE TIER S_EFF FISC EXT DYN  │
    │ ⌖COUNTRY..│  USA  United State  78.4 AA   0.62  62%  45% 55%  │
    │ ≡POLICY...│  DEU  Germany       74.1 AA   0.64  ...  ▁▂▃▄▆▇█ │
    │ ⚠DATA AUD.│                                                 │
    │ ⚙SYSTEM...│                                                 │
    ├───────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
    │ » : commands · Ctrl+F search       14:21:03 open DEU · sort    │
    │ ↑↓ nav · Enter act · Tab→ · 1..6 screens · / palette · q quit  │
    └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Design rules (Bloomberg aesthetics):
  * Amber (yellow) headers on black, edge-to-edge, zero chrome.
  * Bright cyan = interactive selector; green/red = positive/negative;
    bright magenta = alerts; dense grids with box.SIMPLE outer frames
    and box.NONE data tables; ASCII sparklines (▁▂▃▄▅▆▇█) everywhere.
  * Everything is a number; everything is reachable by keyboard.

Data integration (paperflow GFCR v6.0):
  * Dashboard / Macro Matrix   — country_ratings_gfcr (40 cty, round 2026):
      gfcr_score (0-100, higher = more capacity), s_eff and the module
      risk scores (0-1, lower = better), plus 3-year score sparklines.
  * Country Deep-Dive          — 11-module breakdown with mini risk bars,
      90% credible interval (p05/p50/p95), 5-yr macro time series and the
      LLM narrative when present.
  * Policy Events              — policy_events × macro_indicators,
      5 years before vs 5 years after each reform.
  * Data Audit                 — data_audit provenance grid with an
      estimated-only filter (F) + ETL control that streams `paperflow`
      CLI commands in a background subprocess with a live ticker.

Architecture (this rewrite):
  * TerminalState dataclass instead of a loose dict.
  * Dictionary key-dispatch table instead of an if/elif chain.
  * No hardcoded paths: Path.home() + PAPERFLOW_DIR env.
  * Console(width=, height=) constructed dynamically; no private _width.
  * All errors -> ~/.mtui/error.log + visible toast, never swallowed.
  * Read-only mode=ro SQLite pool, thread-safe, self-healing.
=============================================================================
"""
